  ARRAY['Master DHT22 & BME280 Environmental Sensor Interfacing', 'Apply: Wire a DHT22/BME280 to ESP32 with 10kΩ pull-up on data line; read and print calibrated temperature and relative humidity values.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
