  ARRAY['Master Mapping Device-to-Gateway & Cloud Traffic Flows', 'Apply: Trace packet routes using `traceroute` and `ping` from workstation to ESP32; record TTL values and packet loss characteristics.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
