  ARRAY['Master Publishing ESP32 Sensor Telemetry to Local Mosquitto Broker', 'Apply: Connect ESP32 to local Mosquitto broker on port 1883; publish structured JSON payloads containing sensor data and battery status.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
