  'e1000000-0803-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid, 'e1000000-0008-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid, 'e1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid, 'm08-l03-broker-authentication-password-hashing-topic-access-control-acls', 'Module 08 - Lesson 3: Broker Authentication, Password Hashing & Topic Access Control (ACLs)', 'Disable anonymous broker access (`allow_anonymous false`), generate salted password hashes using `mosquitto_passwd`, and configure granular topic ACLs. Practice: Create an ACL rule permitting `device01` to write only to `devices/device01/telemetry` and read only `devices/device01/cmd`.', 'hyJhKWhxAxA', 11, 3,
