  ARRAY['Master Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE): Advertising, GATT & Bonding Security', 'Apply: Use a mobile BLE scanner app (nRF Connect) or `bluetoothctl` to discover nearby BLE devices, enumerate GATT services, and read characteristic permissions.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
