  ARRAY['Master Firmware Acquisition Channels & Legal/Ethical Lab Scope', 'Apply: Download an authorized vendor firmware update (e.g. OpenWrt, D-Link demo image); record download URL, release notes, and legal authorization.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
