  ARRAY['Master Cryptographic Hashing, Verification & Chain of Custody', 'Apply: Generate SHA-256 hash using `sha256sum` in Linux or `Get-FileHash` in PowerShell; create a cryptographic evidence custody record.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
