  ARRAY['Master Binary Headers, Entropy Scanning & Hexdump Inspection', 'Apply: Generate an entropy graph of a firmware image using `binwalk -E`; distinguish low-entropy code sections from high-entropy compressed/encrypted data.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
