  ARRAY['Master Documenting Reverse Engineering Findings & Confidence Limits', 'Apply: Write an annotated vulnerability report for a discovered binary flaw, including function offset, disassembled instructions, decompiled C snippet, and fix.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
