  'e1000000-1601-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid, 'e1000000-0016-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid, 'e1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid, 'm22-l01-qemu-architecture-user-mode-vs-full-system-emulation-in-iot', 'Module 22 - Lesson 1: QEMU Architecture: User-Mode vs Full-System Emulation in IoT', 'Understand QEMU principles: user-mode emulation (`qemu-arm`, `qemu-mips`) for single binaries vs full-system emulation (`qemu-system-arm`) with virtual hardware peripherals. Practice: Configure QEMU user-mode with chroot on an extracted root filesystem; execute an embedded MIPS binary on an x86_64 host.', 'BgqiHTb0y14', 2, 1,
