  'e1000000-1804-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid, 'e1000000-0018-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid, 'e1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid, 'm24-l04-production-hardware-lockdown-efuse-configuration-anti-tamper', 'Module 24 - Lesson 4: Production Hardware Lockdown, eFuse Configuration & Anti-Tamper', 'Design hardware-level protection for production devices: blowing eFuses to permanently disable JTAG/UART bootloaders, removing test pad silkscreen, and applying potting compound. Practice: Review ESP32 eFuse configuration documentation (`espefuse.py`); document the permanent hardware irreversible bits (`DIS_PAD_JTAG`, `DIS_BOOT_REMAP`).', 'jp2LruUba-U', 6, 4,
  ARRAY['Master Production Hardware Lockdown, eFuse Configuration & Anti-Tamper', 'Apply: Review ESP32 eFuse configuration documentation (`espefuse.py`); document the permanent hardware irreversible bits (`DIS_PAD_JTAG`, `DIS_BOOT_REMAP`).', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
  ARRAY['iot', 'module-24', 'hardware-security', 'no-quizzes']::text[],
  ARRAY['Production Hardware Lockdown, eFuse Configuration & Anti-Tamper', 'Defensive IoT engineering']::text[]
