  ARRAY['Master Incident Response: Device Isolation & Containment Procedures', 'Apply: Draft an automated firewall isolation rule blocking all outbound traffic from an infected IP while preserving packet capture capabilities.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
