  ARRAY['Master Remediation, Eradication & Re-Infection Prevention', 'Apply: Create a re-commissioning checklist ensuring remediated hardware cannot be immediately re-infected upon reconnecting to the network.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
