  ARRAY['Master Volatile vs Persistent Evidence Acquisition in Embedded Systems', 'Apply: Document a forensic acquisition protocol for an embedded Linux gateway, prioritizing RAM dumping and network connection capture before unpowering.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
