  ARRAY['Master Purdue Model Architecture: Sensors, PLCs, Gateways, HMIs & Boundaries', 'Apply: Map industrial network components across Purdue levels; identify required firewalls, unidirectional security gateways (data diodes), and demilitarized zones.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
