  ARRAY['Master Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) Generation & Dependency Tracking', 'Apply: Generate an automated CycloneDX SBOM for an ESP32 firmware project using `syft` or `cdxgen`; identify third-party component versions.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
