  ARRAY['Master Coordinated Vulnerability Disclosure (CVD) & Security Contact Setup', 'Apply: Draft a standard `security.txt` file and disclosure policy defining response SLAs (e.g. 7-day initial response, 90-day remediation).', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
