  ARRAY['Master Product Release Security Checklist & Pre-Production Gate Auditing', 'Apply: Perform a mock release gate review on an IoT build; sign off on verified security controls or block release with documented critical defects.', 'Strict <=3.3V DC limits & ethical ROE']::text[],
